  "description": "VAVDII crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C20 Dy2 F30 O20)n. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1_2 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1A_2 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 0.809-0.880 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 12.95-22.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C14H3F21Lu2O15.",
